# Keep AI context small: exclude generated, vendored, large and secret files.
# Active source, tests, configs and docs are intentionally NOT ignored.

## Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
artifacts/
TestResults/
coverage/
dist/
build/

## IDE / caches
.vs/
.idea/
.cache/
tmp/
temp/

## Playwright (browser bundles and reports)
**/.playwright/
**/playwright-report/
**/playwright/.cache/

## Node tooling / vendored deps
node_modules/
vendor/

## Vendored front-end libraries (not authored here)
**/wwwroot/lib/

## Logs
*.log
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

## Secrets & credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
secrets.json
credentials*.json
auth.json
auth.dat
appsettings.*.local.json

## Local data / large fixtures
samples/
*.xlsx
*.csv
seller-groups.json
seller-mails.json
offer-warnings.json
vat-mails.json
**/WhatsApp/profile/
